Fictional EP Tracklist

Track 1: Eleven Minutes Past the Whistle
- Story & Context: In the damp darkness of Shaft 9, young apprentice Lukas realized his pocket watch had stopped precisely when the main air pump seized up. As panic began to set in among the trapped crew, Karl Vogel tapped out a slow swing rhythm on a rusty intake valve, transforming terror into a mesmerizing underground jam session. The echoing steel clangs fused with a sweet, velvet trumpet riff, birthing the very first Pneumaswing groove while everyone waited for the rescue crane. "The clock broke down but the copper pipes keep time," sang Karl through his horn, comforting the men until the surface team breached the ceiling.
